    _deTypeAfter: 1
    _onTextEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onTextStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - _textToType: A few years ago..
    _deTypeAfter: 1
    _onTextEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onTextStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - _textToType: "Recently, when humanity realized that <color=green>Earth</color>
      had become so <color=red>polluted</color> it was nearly <color=red>impossible</color>
      to clean, people understood they could no longer live on the planet. However,
      building rockets to escape proved far <color=red>too expensive</color>. As
      a result, people devised a much <color=green>cheaper</color> alternative \u2013
      <color=red>'bubbles'</color>..."
    _deTypeAfter: 0
    _onTextEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
